---
import { discordLink, inviteCode } from "../../data/community";
---

<section
  id="home"
  class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden pt-20"
  data-invite-code={inviteCode}
>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl px-6 text-center mx-auto pb-12">
    <h1
      class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black mb-8 text-white tracking-tight leading-none animate-[fadeInUp_0.8s_ease-out_0.1s_both]"
    >
      Los<span
        class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f97316] to-[#ea580c] drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(249,115,22,0.3)]"
        >Perris</span
      >
    </h1>

    <p
      class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-white mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed animate-[fadeInUp_0.8s_ease-out_0.2s_both]"
    >
      Bots de Discord y APIs gratuitas de alto rendimiento. Herramientas
      diseñadas para ser rápidas, seguras y fáciles de implementar.
    </p>

    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-6 animate-[fadeInUp_0.8s_ease-out_0.3s_both]"
    >
      <a
        href="#bots"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold transition text-lg bg-[#f97316] text-[#050505] hover:bg-[#ea580c] shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(249,115,22,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(249,115,22,0.5)] hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <i class="fas fa-rocket mr-3 text-xl"></i> Explorar Ecosistema
      </a>
      <a
        href={discordLink}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold transition text-lg bg-[#111111] text-white border border-[#27272a] hover:bg-[#1a1a1a] hover:border-[#3f3f46]"
      >
        <i class="fab fa-discord mr-3 text-xl"></i> Únete a Discord
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-24 text-left animate-[fadeInUp_0.8s_ease-out_0.5s_both]">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl bg-[#0a0a0a] p-5 ring-1 ring-inset ring-[#27272a] transition-all hover:bg-[#111111] hover:ring-[#f97316]/50"
        >
          <div
            class="mb-4 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#111111] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#27272a] text-[#f97316] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
          >
            <i class="fas fa-robot text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Bots de Discord</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-zinc-400">
            Automatización, moderación y entretenimiento para tu servidor.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl bg-[#0a0a0a] p-5 ring-1 ring-inset ring-[#27272a] transition-all hover:bg-[#111111] hover:ring-[#f97316]/50"
        >
          <div
            class="mb-4 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#111111] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#27272a] text-[#f97316] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
          >
            <i class="fas fa-code block text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">APIs Globales</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-zinc-400">
            Endpoints rápidos y seguros para conectar tus aplicaciones.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl bg-[#0a0a0a] p-5 ring-1 ring-inset ring-[#27272a] transition-all hover:bg-[#111111] hover:ring-[#f97316]/50"
        >
          <div
            class="mb-4 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#111111] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#27272a] text-[#f97316] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
          >
            <i class="fas fa-layer-group text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">Paneles Web</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-zinc-400">
            Configura todo desde interfaces gráficas fáciles de usar.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl bg-[#0a0a0a] p-5 ring-1 ring-inset ring-[#27272a] transition-all hover:bg-[#111111] hover:ring-[#f97316]/50"
        >
          <div
            class="mb-4 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#111111] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#27272a] text-[#f97316] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
          >
            <i class="fas fa-users text-lg"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">
            Comunidad Activa
          </div>
          <div class="text-sm text-zinc-400">
            Soporte técnico, recursos y desarrollo colaborativo 24/7.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
